{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 CleanMyMac by MacPaw 為你呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，用 CleanMyMac 先騰出空間、優化系統，等你部新 Mac 喺第一日就可以發揮百分百效能。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 係對 macOS 26 Tahoe 嘅一次重大升級，而且唔單止係因為設計決策更加聰明。就好似 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 一樣，Mac 都加入咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿。用戶可以藉此大幅改變成個系統嘅視覺風格。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。最初 Liquid Glass 只有單一外觀，Apple 之後加入咗一個設定，可以令 Liquid Glass 冇咁透明。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 再唔限於兩種風格。Apple 引入咗一個外觀滑桿，用戶可以將 Liquid Glass 變得比以往更加透明，亦可以採用更具遮蔽感但仍然現代嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設採用中等設定。系統亦會喺初次設定時邀請用戶調整滑桿，用戶之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」入面調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會提供每個設定嘅即時預覽。三個刻度分別代表最透明、中等同最遮蔽，但用戶亦可以喺刻度之間自由調較。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 欄</h2>\n<p>Dock 欄係隨住 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅最明顯元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢嘅範圍可以由清晰顯示你嘅桌面背景，到變成更具遮蔽感同實在感嘅材質。</p>\n<p>等我哋仔細睇下：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>小工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面小工具可以係全彩、暗色，或者自動轉換。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色小工具嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcasts</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcasts 等有系統「正在播放」工具列嘅應用程式，會因應 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而呈現截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以 Podcasts 嘅「正在播放」工具列為例：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而 Music 就係咁：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕上，改變「照片」、Safari 同其他有視窗外框嘅應用程式嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅一點係：單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅所有 Liquid Glass 外觀。即係話 Dock 欄、小工具同視窗外框都會係同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更透明、更遮蔽，定係兩者之間？講個人嚟講，我真係好鍾意遮蔽感較強嗰個選項喺我部 Mac 上成熟又美觀嘅效果。不過，玩吓更透明嘅設定都好有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀咗大家選擇嘅權利。</p>\n<p>歡迎喺留言區分享你嘅睇法！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T16:19:38.933257+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1206,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}